sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Author as Crate author
    participant Rustdoc as rustdoc
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Pele as Pele
    Author->>Rustdoc: document with pele!
    Rustdoc-->>Browser: Mermaid source and script
    alt Pele available
        Browser->>Pele: mount(diagram, source)
        Pele-->>Browser: responsive SVG
        loop On container resize
            Pele-->>Browser: updated layout
        end
    else JavaScript unavailable
        Browser-->>Browser: display Mermaid source
    end
    Note over Browser,Pele: Colors follow rustdoc's theme
